          "quote": "Molybdenum is highly valued in industry because of its unique properties, especially at high temperatures. Additive manufacturing technologies, particularly laser powder bed fusion (LPBF), are becoming increasingly popular for producing complex shapes at a lower cost as compared to the conventional forming processes. However, printing molybdenum with LPBF presents challenges, especially caused by its hot cracking suscepti-\nbility.",
